{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DirectedSimplePaths","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Every simple path of a directed graph from a source to any of a set of targets, lazily, in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"order a depth-first search from the source, taking out-edges in ","type":"text"},{"code":"outEdges","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" order, reaches them.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Structures","generated":true,"anchor":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DirectedSimplePaths\/Iterator"]},{"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DirectedSimplePaths\/maxLength"]},{"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DirectedSimplePaths\/makeIterator()"]},{"title":"Type Aliases","generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Aliases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DirectedSimplePaths\/Element"]},{"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DirectedSimplePaths\/Sequence-Implementations"]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Traversal\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Traversal\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/Traversal\/ST"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DirectedSimplePaths"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"G"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"